-- src:law139-2025-qh15:336 | 7. Bãi bỏ điểm a khoản 1 và khoản 4 Điều 64, Điều 69, khoản 3 Điều 71,
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:337 | khoản 3 Điều 117, điểm a khoản 1 và khoản 4 Điều 133.
@ref Dieu 64 (src:1166-1190; src:law139-2025-qh15:336-337)
`a founder with the right and clean books` MEANS `A founding shareholder or member` WITH
    `has the right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS TRUE
    `is an organisation with legal personality that operates lawfully` IS TRUE
    `contribution as a share of charter capital` IS 5%
    `was profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years to the date of the application` IS FALSE
    `meets the financial conditions the Government sets` IS TRUE
    `is an insurer or reinsurer already licensed in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `meets the capital adequacy ratio under this Law` IS FALSE
`an organisation without the right to found enterprises` MEANS `A founding shareholder or member` WITH
    `has the right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE
    `is an organisation with legal personality that operates lawfully` IS TRUE
    `contribution as a share of charter capital` IS 5%
    `was profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years to the date of the application` IS FALSE
    `meets the financial conditions the Government sets` IS FALSE
    `is an insurer or reinsurer already licensed in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `meets the capital adequacy ratio under this Law` IS FALSE
`an organisation with 10 percent and three profitable years` MEANS `A founding shareholder or member` WITH
    `has the right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS TRUE
    `is an organisation with legal personality that operates lawfully` IS TRUE
    `contribution as a share of charter capital` IS 10%
    `was profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years to the date of the application` IS TRUE
    `meets the financial conditions the Government sets` IS TRUE
    `is an insurer or reinsurer already licensed in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `meets the capital adequacy ratio under this Law` IS FALSE
`an organisation with 10 percent and no profit record` MEANS `A founding shareholder or member` WITH
    `has the right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS TRUE
    `is an organisation with legal personality that operates lawfully` IS TRUE
    `contribution as a share of charter capital` IS 10%
    `was profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years to the date of the application` IS FALSE
    `meets the financial conditions the Government sets` IS FALSE
    `is an insurer or reinsurer already licensed in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `meets the capital adequacy ratio under this Law` IS FALSE
`an organisation with 9 percent and no profit record` MEANS `A founding shareholder or member` WITH
    `has the right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS TRUE
    `is an organisation with legal personality that operates lawfully` IS TRUE
    `contribution as a share of charter capital` IS 9.9%
    `was profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years to the date of the application` IS FALSE
    `meets the financial conditions the Government sets` IS FALSE
    `is an insurer or reinsurer already licensed in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `meets the capital adequacy ratio under this Law` IS FALSE
`a licensed insurer founding a new one, profitable and adequate` MEANS `A founding shareholder or member` WITH
    `has the right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS TRUE
    `is an organisation with legal personality that operates lawfully` IS TRUE
    `contribution as a share of charter capital` IS 30%
    `was profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years to the date of the application` IS TRUE
    `meets the financial conditions the Government sets` IS TRUE
    `is an insurer or reinsurer already licensed in Vietnam` IS TRUE
    `meets the capital adequacy ratio under this Law` IS TRUE
`a licensed insurer founding a new one, ratio short` MEANS `A founding shareholder or member` WITH
    `has the right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS TRUE
    `is an organisation with legal personality that operates lawfully` IS TRUE
    `contribution as a share of charter capital` IS 30%
    `was profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years to the date of the application` IS TRUE
    `meets the financial conditions the Government sets` IS TRUE
    `is an insurer or reinsurer already licensed in Vietnam` IS TRUE
    `meets the capital adequacy ratio under this Law` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `a founder with the right and clean books`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `an organisation without the right to found enterprises`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `an organisation without the right to found enterprises`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `an organisation without the right to found enterprises`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `an organisation with 10 percent and three profitable years`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `an organisation with 10 percent and no profit record`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `an organisation with 10 percent and no profit record`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `an organisation with 9 percent and no profit record`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `a licensed insurer founding a new one, profitable and adequate`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `a licensed insurer founding a new one, ratio short`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `a licensed insurer founding a new one, ratio short`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2022 6 1) (`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` `a founder with the right and clean books`)

`a capital application meeting the minimum` MEANS `A licence application` WITH
    `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong` IS TRUE
    `charter capital` IS 600_000_000_000
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets` IS JUST 600_000_000_000
    `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others` IS FALSE
    `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81` IS FALSE
    `has an organisational form this Law provides` IS FALSE
    `has a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE
`a capital application one dong short` MEANS `A licence application` WITH
    `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong` IS TRUE
    `charter capital` IS 599_999_999_999
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets` IS JUST 600_000_000_000
    `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others` IS FALSE
    `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81` IS FALSE
    `has an organisational form this Law provides` IS FALSE
    `has a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE
`a capital application with borrowed money` MEANS `A licence application` WITH
    `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong` IS TRUE
    `charter capital` IS 700_000_000_000
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets` IS JUST 600_000_000_000
    `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others` IS TRUE
    `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81` IS FALSE
    `has an organisational form this Law provides` IS FALSE
    `has a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE
`a capital application in foreign currency` MEANS `A licence application` WITH
    `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong` IS FALSE
    `charter capital` IS 700_000_000_000
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets` IS JUST 600_000_000_000
    `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others` IS FALSE
    `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81` IS FALSE
    `has an organisational form this Law provides` IS FALSE
    `has a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE
`a capital application with no minimum supplied` MEANS `A licence application` WITH
    `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong` IS TRUE
    `charter capital` IS 700_000_000_000
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets` IS NOTHING
    `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others` IS FALSE
    `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81` IS FALSE
    `has an organisational form this Law provides` IS FALSE
    `has a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 64(2): the capital conditions are met` `a capital application meeting the minimum`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 64(2): the capital conditions are met` `a capital application one dong short`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 64(2): the capital conditions are met` `a capital application with borrowed money`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 64(2): the capital conditions are met` `a capital application in foreign currency`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 64(2): the capital conditions are met` `a capital application with no minimum supplied`
`an application with the personnel` MEANS `A licence application` WITH
    `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong` IS FALSE
    `charter capital` IS 0
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets` IS NOTHING
    `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others` IS FALSE
    `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81` IS TRUE
    `has an organisational form this Law provides` IS TRUE
    `has a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises` IS TRUE
`an application with the personnel but no draft charter` MEANS `A licence application` WITH
    `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong` IS FALSE
    `charter capital` IS 0
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets` IS NOTHING
    `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others` IS FALSE
    `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81` IS TRUE
    `has an organisational form this Law provides` IS TRUE
    `has a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 64(3): the personnel condition is met` `an application with the personnel`
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 64(4): the form of organisation and the draft charter are in order` `an application with the personnel`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 64(4): the form of organisation and the draft charter are in order` `an application with the personnel but no draft charter`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 64(4): the form of organisation and the draft charter are in order` `an application with the personnel`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 64(4): the form of organisation and the draft charter are in order` `an application with the personnel`)

