-- src:law139-2025-qh15:336 | 7. Bãi bỏ điểm a khoản 1 và khoản 4 Điều 64, Điều 69, khoản 3 Điều 71,
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:337 | khoản 3 Điều 117, điểm a khoản 1 và khoản 4 Điều 133.
@ref Dieu 69-72 (src:1284-1342; src:law139-2025-qh15:336-337)
`a full dossier` MEANS `A licence dossier` WITH
    `has the written application` IS TRUE
    `has the draft charter or draft rules of organisation` IS TRUE
    `has the 5-year operating plan with the lines, risk governance, reserves, reinsurance, investment and solvency` IS TRUE
    `has the CVs, criminal records and qualifications of the proposed chair, chief executive, legal representative and actuary` IS TRUE
    `has the capital contribution, the list of holders of 10% or more and proof they meet Dieu 64-67` IS TRUE
    `has the list of beneficial owners` IS TRUE
`a dossier without the beneficial owners` MEANS `A licence dossier` WITH
    `has the written application` IS TRUE
    `has the draft charter or draft rules of organisation` IS TRUE
    `has the 5-year operating plan with the lines, risk governance, reserves, reinsurance, investment and solvency` IS TRUE
    `has the CVs, criminal records and qualifications of the proposed chair, chief executive, legal representative and actuary` IS TRUE
    `has the capital contribution, the list of holders of 10% or more and proof they meet Dieu 64-67` IS TRUE
    `has the list of beneficial owners` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 69: the dossier contains the documents the Law lists` `a full dossier`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 69: the dossier contains the documents the Law lists` `a dossier without the beneficial owners`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 69: the dossier contains the documents the Law lists` `a full dossier`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 69: the dossier contains the documents the Law lists` `a full dossier`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 69(6): the Government's criteria for a beneficial owner`
`a licence granted on day 60` MEANS `A licence decision` WITH
    `date the Ministry of Finance received the complete and valid dossier` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance granted or refused` IS YMD 2025 4 30
    `the refusal was notified in writing with reasons` IS TRUE
    `date the licence was granted` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance published the licence` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date of official operation` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the insurer published the licence and the planned date of official operation` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `published in 3 consecutive issues of a printed newspaper or in an online newspaper` IS FALSE
`a licence granted on day 61` MEANS `A licence decision` WITH
    `date the Ministry of Finance received the complete and valid dossier` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance granted or refused` IS YMD 2025 5 1
    `the refusal was notified in writing with reasons` IS TRUE
    `date the licence was granted` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance published the licence` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date of official operation` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the insurer published the licence and the planned date of official operation` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `published in 3 consecutive issues of a printed newspaper or in an online newspaper` IS FALSE
`a refusal on day 60 without written reasons` MEANS `A licence decision` WITH
    `date the Ministry of Finance received the complete and valid dossier` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance granted or refused` IS YMD 2025 4 30
    `the refusal was notified in writing with reasons` IS FALSE
    `date the licence was granted` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance published the licence` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date of official operation` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the insurer published the licence and the planned date of official operation` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `published in 3 consecutive issues of a printed newspaper or in an online newspaper` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 70(1): the last day for the Ministry of Finance to grant or refuse` `a licence granted on day 60` EQUALS YMD 2025 4 30
#ASSERT `Dieu 70(1): the Ministry of Finance decided in time and, if it refused, said so in writing with reasons` `a licence granted on day 60`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 70(1): the Ministry of Finance decided in time and, if it refused, said so in writing with reasons` `a licence granted on day 61`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 70(1): the Ministry of Finance decided in time and, if it refused, said so in writing with reasons` `a refusal on day 60 without written reasons`
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) `Dieu 71(3): the Ministry of Finance has notified the provincial business registration office in writing`
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) `Dieu 71(3): the Ministry of Finance has notified the provincial business registration office in writing`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 71(4): the Government's rules on the dossier, order and procedure of licensing`
`a licence published on day 30 and in the newspaper on day 30 before operation` MEANS `A licence decision` WITH
    `date the Ministry of Finance received the complete and valid dossier` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance granted or refused` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the refusal was notified in writing with reasons` IS FALSE
    `date the licence was granted` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance published the licence` IS YMD 2025 3 31
    `date of official operation` IS YMD 2025 6 1
    `date the insurer published the licence and the planned date of official operation` IS YMD 2025 5 2
    `published in 3 consecutive issues of a printed newspaper or in an online newspaper` IS TRUE
`a licence published on day 31 and in the newspaper 29 days before operation` MEANS `A licence decision` WITH
    `date the Ministry of Finance received the complete and valid dossier` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance granted or refused` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the refusal was notified in writing with reasons` IS FALSE
    `date the licence was granted` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the Ministry of Finance published the licence` IS YMD 2025 4 1
    `date of official operation` IS YMD 2025 6 1
    `date the insurer published the licence and the planned date of official operation` IS YMD 2025 5 3
    `published in 3 consecutive issues of a printed newspaper or in an online newspaper` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 72(1): the Ministry of Finance published in time` `a licence published on day 30 and in the newspaper on day 30 before operation`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 72(1): the Ministry of Finance published in time` `a licence published on day 31 and in the newspaper 29 days before operation`
#ASSERT `Dieu 72(2): the insurer published the licence at least 30 days before official operation in the way required` `a licence published on day 30 and in the newspaper on day 30 before operation`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 72(2): the insurer published the licence at least 30 days before official operation in the way required` `a licence published on day 31 and in the newspaper 29 days before operation`

