    `internal rules and basic business procedures were issued` IS FALSE
    `the deposit was made in full at a commercial bank` IS FALSE
    `premises, facilities and technology fit the business procedures` IS FALSE
    `the licence was published as Dieu 72(2) requires` IS FALSE
    `date the insurer notified the Ministry of Finance that these were done` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `carried on insurance business before the date of official operation` IS FALSE
