#ASSERT `Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` `a change of name or of head office address` EQUALS `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` `a change of charter capital or allocated capital` EQUALS `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` `a transfer of shares taking a holder to or above 10%, or below 10%` EQUALS `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` `an investment abroad, including a branch or representative office` EQUALS `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` `a change of the beneficial owners` EQUALS `written notice to the Ministry of Finance within 15 days of the change`
#ASSERT `Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` `opening, ending or moving a branch or representative office` EQUALS `written notice to the Ministry of Finance within 15 days of the change`
-- the NAME of a branch or representative office: no step in V1, a notice from V2 (Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(4))
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` `a change of the name of a branch or representative office`) EQUALS `no step stated`
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` `a change of the name of a branch or representative office`) EQUALS `written notice to the Ministry of Finance within 15 days of the change`
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` `a change of the name of a branch or representative office`) EQUALS `written notice to the Ministry of Finance within 15 days of the change`
#ASSERT `Dieu 74(3): the last day to give written notice` (YMD 2025 3 1) EQUALS YMD 2025 3 16
#ASSERT `Dieu 74(2): the last day for the Ministry of Finance to publish the change` (YMD 2025 3 1) EQUALS YMD 2025 3 11
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 74(4): the Government's rules on the conditions, dossier and procedure of approving and recording changes`

