#ASSERT `Dieu 75(2): the insurer must stop making new contracts at once and transfer its portfolio` `the dossier contained fraudulent information`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 75(2): the insurer must stop making new contracts at once and transfer its portfolio` `official operation did not begin within the time Dieu 73(1) allows`
#ASSERT `Dieu 75(2): the insurer must stop making new contracts at once and transfer its portfolio` `the enterprise was divided, merged, consolidated, dissolved or ceased`
#ASSERT `Dieu 75(2): the insurer must stop making new contracts at once and transfer its portfolio` `the enterprise acted outside the content of its licence`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 75(2): the insurer must stop making new contracts at once and transfer its portfolio` `a court declared the insurer or reinsurer bankrupt`
#ASSERT `Dieu 75(2): the insurer must stop making new contracts at once and transfer its portfolio` `the foreign parent of a foreign branch was declared bankrupt or lost its licence`
`a liaison office for five years` MEANS `A foreign representative office` WITH
    `the activity is business of insurance in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `is a liaison office` IS TRUE
    `is market research` IS FALSE
    `promotes or monitors the investment projects of the parent` IS FALSE
    `is another activity consistent with Vietnamese law` IS FALSE
    `term of operation in years` IS 5
    `years the parent has operated, latest` IS 5
    `the home regulator allowed the office` IS TRUE
`a liaison office for six years` MEANS `A foreign representative office` WITH
    `the activity is business of insurance in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `is a liaison office` IS TRUE
    `is market research` IS FALSE
    `promotes or monitors the investment projects of the parent` IS FALSE
    `is another activity consistent with Vietnamese law` IS FALSE
    `term of operation in years` IS 6
    `years the parent has operated, latest` IS 0
    `the home regulator allowed the office` IS FALSE
`an office selling insurance` MEANS `A foreign representative office` WITH
    `the activity is business of insurance in Vietnam` IS TRUE
    `is a liaison office` IS TRUE
    `is market research` IS FALSE
    `promotes or monitors the investment projects of the parent` IS FALSE
    `is another activity consistent with Vietnamese law` IS FALSE
    `term of operation in years` IS 1
    `years the parent has operated, latest` IS 0
    `the home regulator allowed the office` IS FALSE
`a parent with four years` MEANS `A foreign representative office` WITH
    `the activity is business of insurance in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `is a liaison office` IS FALSE
    `is market research` IS FALSE
    `promotes or monitors the investment projects of the parent` IS FALSE
    `is another activity consistent with Vietnamese law` IS FALSE
    `term of operation in years` IS 0
    `years the parent has operated, latest` IS 4
    `the home regulator allowed the office` IS TRUE
`a parent not allowed by its regulator` MEANS `A foreign representative office` WITH
    `the activity is business of insurance in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `is a liaison office` IS FALSE
    `is market research` IS FALSE
    `promotes or monitors the investment projects of the parent` IS FALSE
    `is another activity consistent with Vietnamese law` IS FALSE
    `term of operation in years` IS 0
    `years the parent has operated, latest` IS 10
    `the home regulator allowed the office` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 76: the representative office's activity and term are permitted` `a liaison office for five years`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 76: the representative office's activity and term are permitted` `a liaison office for six years`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 76: the representative office's activity and term are permitted` `an office selling insurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 77(1): the foreign body may set up the representative office` `a liaison office for five years`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 77(1): the foreign body may set up the representative office` `a parent with four years`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 77(1): the foreign body may set up the representative office` `a parent not allowed by its regulator`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 76(4) and 77(2): the Minister of Finance's and the Government's rules on reports, changes, licensing of representative offices`

