@ref Dieu 81 (src:1546-1603; src:law139-2025-qh15:74-139)
`a candidate clean on the general conditions` MEANS `A candidate officer` WITH
    `holds the right to manage enterprises under the Law on Enterprises` IS FALSE
    `has no administrative penalty in insurance` IS TRUE
    `was not dismissed for breaching internal procedures in the 3 continuous years before the appointment` IS TRUE
    `is not prosecuted at the time of election or appointment` IS TRUE
    `has a university degree or higher` IS FALSE
    `has a degree in insurance` IS FALSE
    `has a degree in economics, finance, banking, law, business administration, accounting or auditing that includes an insurance subject` IS FALSE
    `has a degree in another field that includes an insurance subject` IS FALSE
    `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate from a lawful training body in Vietnam or abroad` IS FALSE
    `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate suited to the types of insurance the insurer may carry on` IS FALSE
    `years working directly in insurance, finance or banking` IS 0
    `years as a manager, executive or controller of an enterprise or organisation operating directly in insurance, finance or banking` IS 0
    `years as a manager or controller of an insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch` IS 0
    `years of experience in insurance, finance, banking or the intended specialty` IS 0
    `years of experience in insurance or the intended specialty` IS 0
    `resides in Vietnam while in office` IS FALSE
