    `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate from a lawful training body in Vietnam or abroad` IS FALSE
    `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate suited to the types of insurance the insurer may carry on` IS FALSE
    `years working directly in insurance, finance or banking` IS 0
    `years as a manager, executive or controller of an enterprise or organisation operating directly in insurance, finance or banking` IS 0
    `years as a manager or controller of an insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch` IS 0
    `years of experience in insurance, finance, banking or the intended specialty` IS 0
    `years of experience in insurance or the intended specialty` IS 0
    `resides in Vietnam while in office` IS FALSE
