`an actuary with no other post` MEANS `A person's posts` WITH
    `main post` IS `actuary`
    `other posts held in the same organisation` IS EMPTY
    `works at another insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch in Vietnam at the same time` IS FALSE
`an actuary who also heads pricing` MEANS `A person's posts` WITH
    `main post` IS `actuary`
    `other posts held in the same organisation` IS LIST `head of the pricing department`
    `works at another insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch in Vietnam at the same time` IS FALSE
`an actuary who also heads something else` MEANS `A person's posts` WITH
    `main post` IS `actuary`
    `other posts held in the same organisation` IS LIST `another management post`
    `works at another insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch in Vietnam at the same time` IS FALSE
`an actuary working at a second insurer` MEANS `A person's posts` WITH
    `main post` IS `actuary`
    `other posts held in the same organisation` IS EMPTY
    `works at another insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch in Vietnam at the same time` IS TRUE
`a head of risk who also heads pricing` MEANS `A person's posts` WITH
    `main post` IS `head of risk management`
    `other posts held in the same organisation` IS LIST `head of the pricing department`
    `works at another insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch in Vietnam at the same time` IS FALSE
`a chief accountant with no other post` MEANS `A person's posts` WITH
    `main post` IS `chief accountant`
    `other posts held in the same organisation` IS EMPTY
    `works at another insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch in Vietnam at the same time` IS FALSE
`a chief accountant who also heads finance and accounting` MEANS `A person's posts` WITH
    `main post` IS `chief accountant`
    `other posts held in the same organisation` IS LIST `head of finance and accounting`
    `works at another insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch in Vietnam at the same time` IS FALSE
`a head of internal audit who also heads finance and accounting` MEANS `A person's posts` WITH
    `main post` IS `head of internal audit`
    `other posts held in the same organisation` IS LIST `head of finance and accounting`
    `works at another insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch in Vietnam at the same time` IS FALSE
`a chief accountant at two insurers` MEANS `A person's posts` WITH
    `main post` IS `chief accountant`
    `other posts held in the same organisation` IS EMPTY
    `works at another insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch in Vietnam at the same time` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 82(4): the actuary, head of risk management or head of compliance control holds an allowed combination of posts` `an actuary with no other post`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 82(4): the actuary, head of risk management or head of compliance control holds an allowed combination of posts` `an actuary who also heads pricing`)
