#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 82(4): the actuary, head of risk management or head of compliance control holds an allowed combination of posts` `an actuary who also heads something else`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 82(4): the actuary, head of risk management or head of compliance control holds an allowed combination of posts` `an actuary working at a second insurer`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 82(4): the actuary, head of risk management or head of compliance control holds an allowed combination of posts` `a head of risk who also heads pricing`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 82(4): the actuary, head of risk management or head of compliance control holds an allowed combination of posts` `a chief accountant with no other post`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 82(6): the chief accountant or head of internal audit holds an allowed combination of posts` `a chief accountant with no other post`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 82(6): the chief accountant or head of internal audit holds an allowed combination of posts` `a chief accountant who also heads finance and accounting`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 82(6): the chief accountant or head of internal audit holds an allowed combination of posts` `a chief accountant who also heads finance and accounting`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 82(6): the chief accountant or head of internal audit holds an allowed combination of posts` `a head of internal audit who also heads finance and accounting`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 82(6): the chief accountant or head of internal audit holds an allowed combination of posts` `a chief accountant at two insurers`)
